  "title": {
    "type": "text",
    "$t": "埔里做三獻"
  },
  "content": {
    "type": "html",
    "$t": "<p><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><span><b>作者：</b></span></span><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><b>Táng Huī-bûn</b></span></p><div><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\"><br /></div></div><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">「家家戶戶牽燈kat綵，刣豬倒羊……」若講著埔里鎮上kài鬧熱ê活動，就ài講著一紀年一擺ê做醮，見若niáu鼠年就做醮、兔仔年就做三獻，到tann有123年ê歷史--ah。</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><br /></span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">埔里做醮拄開始是為著慶祝恒吉宮媽祖廟落成，hit當時地方tiānn-tiānn有衝突，死亡ê人數tsiânn濟，mā ǹg望借tsit个機會安慰亡魂，三年後慶祝醮有順序，koh辦三獻。Tsit-má總壇猶原設tī媽祖廟，東、西、南、北設四大柱，規个埔里鎮，加上仁愛鄉ê南豐村kah大同村，鬧熱kah，各壇有家己ê主題，有在地ê特色，親像用花蕊佈置做埔里人落雨天ná騎oo-tóo-bái ná攑雨傘ê形象，mā有現代ê元素，親像講「鋼鐵俠」。</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span></span></p><a name='more'></a><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><br /></span><p></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">做醮進前封山禁水，全埔里鎮食菜幾若工，逐家講好話、做好事，祈求地方平安；到大拜拜hit工，逐家伙lóng tshuân kah tsiok tshenn-tshau，用擔--ê、用載--ê，普渡ê桌仔排kah滿滿滿，beh hōo孤魂野鬼食hōo飽。Hiàng時koh有飼豬公比賽，血水tsha̍p-tsha̍p滴，tī眾人ê拍拚之下，2020年四大柱原本ài刣ê豬kah羊改用炊粉來排，古錐ê模樣hōo人sio爭beh kah伊hip相。</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><br /></span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">現此時ê醮有佛教團體煮素食hōo人食、環保團體招無肉ê擔仔位來排市仔……，m̄-nā是傳統ê道教儀式--ah，醮壇ê suí吸引濟濟來看鬧熱ê人，已經tsiânn做是縣級無形ê文化資產。今年（2023年）12月18是三獻，歡迎逐家來埔里鬥鬧熱；三冬前ê做醮，高速公路that kah tsa̍t-thóng-thóng，聽外地人講beh tńg--去半暝tsiah到厝，若有閒ē-sái ke蹛一暝留落來tshit-thô。</span></p><div style=\"text-align: justify;\"><br /></div><span></span><span><!--more--></span><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\"><a href=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEgAevSoT1puxThireOH7rbkLCIDzwuHlEH3910JEp_QZjIy3RxTU1GREoksI_LrmkOJhJ3c-9vJKX2gWdGd4kESHZQwM9KCNsHxUzVuWmC0ayRY2_rW_5Q1NVk0ypCVT29f7Dq4R17_vwKSQEbWBhQmit-dlUO25hbRkjPbn1YIDWend9a2Mz6OS_UQoAHL/s3036/%E5%8F%B0%E6%96%87%E9%80%9A%E8%A8%8ABONG%E5%A0%B1356%E6%9C%9F_%E9%BB%91%E7%99%BD%E5%85%A7%E9%A0%8148%E9%A0%8125.jpg\" style=\"margin-left: 1em; margin-right: 1em;\"><img border=\"0\" data-original-height=\"3036\" data-original-width=\"2150\" height=\"640\" src=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEgAevSoT1puxThireOH7rbkLCIDzwuHlEH3910JEp_QZjIy3RxTU1GREoksI_LrmkOJhJ3c-9vJKX2gWdGd4kESHZQwM9KCNsHxUzVuWmC0ayRY2_rW_5Q1NVk0ypCVT29f7Dq4R17_vwKSQEbWBhQmit-dlUO25hbRkjPbn1YIDWend9a2Mz6OS_UQoAHL/w454-h640/%E5%8F%B0%E6%96%87%E9%80%9A%E8%A8%8ABONG%E5%A0%B1356%E6%9C%9F_%E9%BB%91%E7%99%BD%E5%85%A7%E9%A0%8148%E9%A0%8125.jpg\" width=\"454\" /></a></div><br /><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\"><a href=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEi7U4GBYB_pCwiPZOrWYlYs8wL5e_JXdpOTxq5_9GjF9Km078o0aIxOUYVHTWHaLRohYKhSvY2GHixi1Pa9jifjTWaLeBfEq2NvIYHJ_1EwG4qUQ87_FOaTJ6KTFZQZOm9smh_vvuvXuxoosd05BGz25-SzCDCdrXXJunfTup76kzou2GomGsqZeREn_o8H/s1424/356%E5%8F%B0%E6%96%87%E9%80%9A%E8%A8%8ABONG%E5%A0%B1_%E5%B0%81%E9%9D%A2.jpg\" imageanchor=\"1\" style=\"margin-left: 1em; margin-right: 1em;\"><img border=\"0\" data-original-height=\"1424\" data-original-width=\"1000\" height=\"640\" src=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEi7U4GBYB_pCwiPZOrWYlYs8wL5e_JXdpOTxq5_9GjF9Km078o0aIxOUYVHTWHaLRohYKhSvY2GHixi1Pa9jifjTWaLeBfEq2NvIYHJ_1EwG4qUQ87_FOaTJ6KTFZQZOm9smh_vvuvXuxoosd05BGz25-SzCDCdrXXJunfTup76kzou2GomGsqZeREn_o8H/w450-h640/356%E5%8F%B0%E6%96%87%E9%80%9A%E8%A8%8ABONG%E5%A0%B1_%E5%B0%81%E9%9D%A2.jpg\" width=\"450\" /></a></div><br /><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\"><br /></div><div style=\"text-align: center;\"><b>恒吉宮媽祖廟</b></div><div style=\"text-align: center;\"><a href=\"https://reurl.cc/m0bYZ7\" target=\"_blank\">https://reurl.cc/m0bYZ7</a></div><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\"><br /></div><br /><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear